# Local end-to-end audit

When the app owner explicitly asks for a full/local end-to-end audit, follow
[`docs/END_TO_END_AUDIT.md`](../../docs/END_TO_END_AUDIT.md) before testing.
Reuse the owner's local services and designated local Mongo DB; preserve the
worktree and treat all records as potentially real. Do not perform state-changing
admin actions, paid provider calls, manual refreshes, CAS actions, or trades
without explicit approval for that exact action.

Produce a sanitized, dated report at
`docs/audits/LOCAL_END_TO_END_AUDIT_YYYY-MM-DD.md` with what worked, prioritized
evidence-based findings, validation results, and tested/untested/blocked
coverage. Distinguish observations from source-only conclusions and projections.
Do not fix findings during an audit-only request.
